v 3
d 'DAGPLOT': dagy's own interactive graph viewer
d
d dagplot is dagy's minimal, self-contained interactive (cytoscape.js-
d based) graph viewer that "dagy draw" plots through - no "network
d object" model, no static-plot output, just what dagy draw needs.
d Requires the companion package dagy:
d       net install dagy, from("https://raw.githubusercontent.com/thomas-u-grund/dagy/main/software/dagy/")
d
d On macOS this ships a compiled chromeless native viewer binary. On
d Windows/Linux (no native binary shipped yet) the same interactive
d viewer opens in your default web browser instead - everything works
d the same way, just inside a browser tab.
d
d KW: DAG
d KW: graph
d KW: visualization
d
d Requires: Stata version 16
d
d Author: Thomas Grund
d Support: email thomas.u.grund@gmail.com
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260917
d
